  "title": "German Rhubarb Streusel Cake",
  "description": "This German rhubarb cake with streusel is super delicious and easy to make as the dough for the crust and the crunchy streusel topping are the same.",
  "authors": [
    "Barbara Sauermann"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:27:26-04:00",
